    {
      "id": "efc12f12-bd03-4a34-b535-b1c9511da6f0",
      "label": "ProcedureDivisionBodyContext/efc12f12-bd03-4a34-b535-b1c9511da6f0",
      "name": "ProcedureDivisionBodyContext/efc12f12-bd03-4a34-b535-b1c9511da6f0",
      "originalText": "MAINLINE SECTION.\n       \n           INITIALIZE WS-HEADER.\n       \n           MOVE EIBTRNID TO WS-TRANSID.\n           MOVE EIBTRMID TO WS-TERMID.\n           MOVE EIBTASKN TO WS-TASKNUM.\n       \n       \n           IF EIBCALEN IS EQUAL TO ZERO\n               MOVE \u0027 NO COMMAREA RECEIVED\u0027 TO EM-VARIABLE\n               PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE\n               _DIALECT_ 1 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​ ​​​​​​ ​​​​​​​​\n           END-IF\n       \n       \n           MOVE \u002700\u0027 TO CA-RETURN-CODE\n           MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.\n           SET WS-ADDR-DFHCOMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.\n       \n       \n           _DIALECT_ 2 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n               ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n           ​​​​​​​​.\n       \n           _DIALECT_ 3 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​ ​​​​​​​​.\n       \n       MAINLINE-EXIT.\n           EXIT.\n       \n       \n       \n       \n       \n       \n       \n       WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE.\n       \n       \n           _DIALECT_ 4 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n           ​​​​​​​​\n           _DIALECT_ 5 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n                     ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n           ​​​​​​​​\n           MOVE DATE1 TO EM-DATE\n           MOVE TIME1 TO EM-TIME\n       \n           _DIALECT_ 6 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n                     ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n           ​​​​​​​​.\n       \n           IF EIBCALEN \u003e 0 THEN\n             IF EIBCALEN \u003c 91 THEN\n               MOVE DFHCOMMAREA(1:EIBCALEN) TO CA-DATA\n               _DIALECT_ 7 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n                         ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n               ​​​​​​​​\n             ELSE\n               MOVE DFHCOMMAREA(1:90) TO CA-DATA\n               _DIALECT_ 8 ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​ ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n                         ​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n               ​​​​​​​​\n             END-IF\n           END-IF.\n           EXIT.",
      "type": "PROCEDURE_DIVISION_BODY",
      "categories": [
        "CODE_BLOCK"
      ],
      "nodeType": "CODE_VERTEX"
    },
